/* Hallmark · shape: Ledger Proof · genre: modern-minimal · theme: Coral (deal: manual) · job: sign up · draw: manual
 * hero: Stage · nav: edge-aligned, a wordmark and one action · footer: a mast · imagery: the product, built as stationery · signature: the statement of what you are owed, the paid row pressed in coral
 * axes: light/grotesk-sans/warm · posture: restrained · contrast: hand-checked · fold: hand-checked (no render run) · v2.0.0 */
/* Hallmark · pre-emit critique: P4 H4 E3 S4 R4 V4 · weakest: E, sloplint could not run in this harness, so every Floor item was walked by hand */
/* Hallmark · answered F4 · two ink buttons, both the one Start free action: the hero sends you to the form, the form submits it */
/* Hallmark · waive 47c · the statement, reminder and client records are Coral stationery built in CSS · Ledgerly has no running app to capture yet, and Coral builds its records as paper */
@import url("./tokens.css");
@import url("./base.css");

/* ---------- shared material ---------- */

.defs { position: absolute; width: 0; height: 0; overflow: hidden; }
